      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. any improvements other then multi threaded engine and deployment in k8s in perps ?\nwhat else will break in case of scale other then engine\n \n2. i currently chat with ai while i am building projects is it ok ? i find it difficult \nto code in contest, i understand what is the goal but can't code that fast and \nwith a clear scope\n\n3. any advice that i should do  or make changes in ?",
